---
export interface Props { theme?: 'paper' | 'night'; }
const { theme = 'paper' } = Astro.props;
---
<footer class:list={['footer', theme === 'night' && 'footer--night']}>
  <div class="footer-inner">
    <div>
      <p class="footer-brand">和音滇韵</p>
      <p class="footer-sub">以音乐为桥，连接京滇山海。</p>
    </div>
    <div class="footer-meta">
      <p>北京科技大学 · 酉良和音滇韵民族团结实践团</p>
      <p>2026 年暑期社会实践</p>
    </div>
    <a class="footer-github" href="https://github.com/Finderlzy/DianRhyme" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="在 GitHub 查看项目">GitHub <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
  </div>
  <div class="footer-bottom"><span>十四日音乐支教田野纪事</span><span>© 2026 和音滇韵</span></div>
</footer>
<style>
  .footer { margin-top: var(--space-section); padding: 52px max(20px, calc((100vw - var(--max-width)) / 2)); border-top: 1px solid var(--line); background: var(--paper-white); }
  .footer--night { border-color: var(--line-light); background: var(--night); color: var(--paper-white); }
  .footer-inner { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.4fr 1fr auto; align-items: end; gap: 36px; width: 100%; max-width: var(--max-width); margin: 0 auto; }
  .footer-brand { color: inherit; font-family: var(--font-heading); font-size: 1.45rem; }
  .footer-sub, .footer-meta { margin-top: 8px; color: var(--mist); font-size: 0.84rem; }
  .footer-meta { margin: 0; line-height: 1.9; }
  .footer-github { color: inherit; font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.78rem; }
  .footer-github span { color: var(--lacquer); }
  .footer-bottom { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 24px; max-width: var(--max-width); margin: 36px auto 0; padding-top: 14px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); color: var(--mist); font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.68rem; letter-spacing: 0.04em; }
  .footer--night .footer-bottom { border-color: var(--line-light); }
  @media (max-width: 700px) { .footer-inner { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 20px; } .footer-github { justify-self: start; } .footer-bottom { flex-direction: column; gap: 5px; } }
</style>
